  "description": "A stable, mature adult relationship, a real romance, and love. For Seong-Jun, a gay man who seems to attract total losers like a magnet, these are things that seem out of reach, yet are like fantasies he desires more than anyone else. He vows that this relationship will definitely be a success, but before he knows it, he’s been dumped for the millionth time (?) without even knowing why. Then one day, he goes on a date with Yong-Hyeon, his dream guy, and after two months of enjoying a flirty, casual relationship, Seong-Jun hears something shocking from Yong-Hyeon. Will Seong-Jun be able to succeed in the “romance” he’s always dreamed of in the cutthroat gay community?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
